WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.320
A rich man asks Jesus what he must do.

2
00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:06.990
Told to sell his possessions,
he goes away sad.

3
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:12.580
Then comes a startling picture: a camel
squeezing through the eye of a needle.

4
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:16.830
Yet many believers see wealth as
a gift that can do great good.

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:21.750
So if Jesus warned the rich so strongly,
can a religious person ever be rich with

6
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.510
a clear conscience?

7
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:27.780
In this mission, you'll test a famous
saying about money against what the Bible

8
00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:29.300
actually says.

9
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:34.340
Then you'll find out what an old proverb
says the rich and the poor have in common.

10
00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:38.840
Your mission: weigh up whether being
rich can fit with a life of faith.
